          "ruleId": "CWE-312",
          "ruleIndex": 3,
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "IPTV provider credentials published to public third-party store under enumerable 4-digit code\n\nThe \"Create Activation Code\" feature publishes the user's full IPTV login (provider URL, username and password) to a **public, unauthenticated third-party key-value store** (`keyvalue.immanuel.co`) as plain base64, under a **user-chosen 4-digit key**. Anyone can read any record back without authentication using the app key hard-coded in the client, and the entire 10,000-code keyspace can be swept in a couple of minutes. Any other Doggy Player user who ever created a sharing code therefore has their provider password exposed."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
