            "text": "DOM XSS in statistics window chart renderer via unencoded chart data\n\nThe statistics window builds its chart by assigning an HTML template string to chart.innerHTML, interpolating row.date into a title attribute and into element text without encoding. The window runs with nodeIntegration true, and its CSP allows unsafe-inline."
