          "message": {
            "text": "Open redirect — Ruled out: electron/main.js:806-808 res.redirect(videoPath) on the loopback /stream server\n\nThe redirect target is `req.query.path`, which the same requester already supplied, on a server bound to 127.0.0.1 that requires the `streamToken` query value first (main.js:719). A redirect adds no authority the caller did not already hold and cannot be reached by a third party without that token, so there is no open-redirect impact. It is recorded as input to vuln-0001's URL-policy fix rather than as a separate finding."
          },
